```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant Backend
    participant MetaMask
    participant Blockchain

    User->>Frontend: Login via Email/Password
    Frontend->>Backend: Authenticate (JWT)
    Backend-->>Frontend: Session Created
    
    User->>Frontend: Click "Verify & Link Wallet"
    Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/wallet/link
    Backend-->>Frontend: Return Challenge Nonce
    
    Frontend->>MetaMask: Prompt Signature for Nonce
    User->>MetaMask: Approve Signature
    MetaMask-->>Frontend: Return Signed Message Hash
    
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/wallet/link (Address, Signature, Nonce)
    Backend->>Backend: Verify Signature (ecrecover)
    Backend->>Backend: Check Duplicate Addresses
    Backend->>Backend: Update User DB (linkedWalletAddress)
    Backend-->>Frontend: Success Response
    
    Frontend-->>User: Wallet Successfully Verified & Linked
```
